          "Energy and Movement", "energy and movement",
          "energy in moving things, elastic bands and springs, wheels and axles, and pushes, pulls and friction",
          "Stretched elastic bands and springs store energy.", "Wheels and axles make it easier to move loads.",
          "A moving object has energy of movement (kinetic energy). A stretched elastic band or a squashed spring stores energy; when it is let go, the energy makes something move, as in a catapult or a wind-up toy.",
